          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abamoabu boonaboona bwe baawulira nga bakyabazinga abasatu baidhie okubalwanisa, baasoloza abantu boonaboona abato n'abakulu abaali nga basobola okugema eby'okulwanisa, baabaleeta ku nsalosalo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abamoabu bwe baasitukagho enkyo ku nkyo, endhuba yaayaka ku maadhi agaboolekeire, baagabona nga gamyuse ng'oti musaayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baakoba bati: “Guno musaayi! Bwenebwene bakyabazinga balwanagaine beene na beene, baitagana. Imwe Abamoabu, mukole tuje ku munhago!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye bwe baatuuka Abaisiraeli ghe baasimba weema dhaibwe, Abaisiraeli baasituka baalumba Abamoabu abo, baabatwaliriza embiro. Abamoabu baalumuka, aye Abaisiraeli baababingirira nga baja bwe babaita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisiraeli baazikiriza ebibuga, buli mulala yaasuula eibaale mu bulime obulungi, okutuusa nga babwidhwiza amabaale. Baasemba ensulo dhoonadhoona edh'amaadhi, era baatema emiti gyonagyona emirungi. Mu kibuga Kiriharesethi mwonka mwe baaleka amabaale gaamu, ab'ensuumulo baakyezunguluza baakighangula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
